module j3.j2.lex — The j2 lexer: source text to tokens with line:col (1-based; col counts bytes). `//` comments,

fn: syntaxError lex strText decode quote escapeInto escapeFor fmtFloat describe
enum Tok: Eof Name Int Float Str TplHead TplMid TplTail LParen RParen LBrace RBrace LBrack RBrack
    Comma Semi Colon Dot DotDot Assign Eq Not Ne Lt Le Gt Ge Plus Minus Star Slash Percent And Or
    PlusEq MinusEq StarEq SlashEq PercentEq Let Const Fn Return If Else While For In Break Continue
    Match Pub Use Nil True False
struct Token: kind s e line col i f
struct SyntaxError: file line col msg text
trait Sink: push() pushStr() pushInt()

signatures and comments: `j3c doc j3.j2.lex`; one name: `j3c doc j3.j2.lex <name>`
--- stderr
--- exit 0
